cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "EpiDataKit.jl: Retrieval and standardization of epidemiological surveillance data in Julia"
abstract: >-
  A Julia package for retrieving epidemiological surveillance data from the Delphi Epidata
  API, standardizing it into a tidy schema, and persisting it as Apache Arrow for downstream 
  simulation and inference work. Handles MMWR epiweek conversion, geographic identifier normalization, 
  coded missingness, and data revisions.
type: software

